OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACPS apologises to man after
OL,4,AThetford prison error
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe CPS also confirmed that the charges
OL,7,Fwere dropped against Jobson on Friday,
OL,8,Fbut he was not released from prison
OL,9,Funtil the following day with his family
OL,10,Ftelling the BBC they were "in bits".
OL,12,FA CPS spokesperson said it had been
OL,13,Falerted on Saturday to an "inaccuracy
OL,14,Fin the notice sent to the prison".
